WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.953
Varbase comes with a demo user for each role. Each one sees a different set of tools. Let us compare them.

2
00:00:08.953 --> 00:00:16.371
A normal user can log in and manage their own account, but has no administration area.

3
00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:26.247
A content editor writes blog posts and utility pages, and can publish them. Canvas pages need someone else to publish.

4
00:00:26.247 --> 00:00:35.586
A site admin also manages accounts and many site settings. Only a super admin can change roles and permissions.
